  "design": {
    "idea": "Two silk threads of unequal length race from one starter spool to a thorn-wall snare and a distant timed brazier; rotate the Blue Transformer to freeze the short branch as a firebreak, then ignite the starter spool so only the long thread reaches the north brazier.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ki",
    "teaches": "Using Blue silk-freeze as a selective firebreak on branching conducting threads so fire only travels the safe long route.",
